/E (The Q1 2026 Crypto Sectors Index Returns chart provides a clear overview of the broad market drawdown during the first quarter. Across the board, every major crypto sector recorded negative returns, reflecting a significant risk-off environment. Artificial Intelligence proved to be the most resilient sector, showing a relatively modest decline of -14%, followed closely by Financials at -15%. In contrast, Consumer & Culture was the worst performer with a sharp -31% drop, while core sectors like Smart Contract Platforms and Currencies both saw a -21% decline. This sectoral dispersion indicates that while the entire market retracted, AI and financial primitives maintained better relative strength compared to more speculative or consumer-facing assets.)
