/Title (Q2: What is the significance of "Fiscal Dominance" for the long-term Bitcoin thesis?A: With US Federal Debt at $38.5T and the interest-to-revenue ratio exceeding the 30% terminal threshold, organic debt repayment is mathematically impossible. This necessitates debt monetization \(money printing\), which acts as a massive structural tailwind for absolute scarce assets like Bitcoin.)
