/Title (Q3: Which sectors showed the most resilience during the Q1 market correction?A: Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) and Financials were the most resilient, losing only -14% and -15% respectively. In contrast, Consumer & Culture was the worst performer \(-31%\), indicating that capital preferred sectors with clear technological or financial utility during high volatility.)
